            "title": "What is timeframe for canceling my subscription before it renews again?",
            "text": "<p>Subscription customers can log into their subscription portal to view details of their upcoming order(s). Additionally, an automated email is sent out 3 days prior to a subscription order payment processing. Best practice is to log into the portal to make changes or to cancel your subscription order 24 hours before the order is set to process.</p>"
